{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program' data-target='computer\/program' data-title='Program'>\r\n\t\t\tProgram\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_tomcat' data-title='Apache Tomcat'>\r\n\t\t\tApache Tomcat\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/ssl' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/ssl' data-title='SSL'>\r\n\t\t\tSSL\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"The certificate file i.e. keystore file can be a .p12 file, need not be a ‘.jks’.","label":"Notes","prevArticle":null,"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/ssl\/redirect_http_to_https","label":"Redirect: HTTP to HTTPS","url":"\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/ssl\/redirect_http_to_https"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t\t<div class='content-image-container'>\r\n\t<div class='cover-image cover-image-tile'>\r\n\t\t<img src='\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/ssl\/notes.svg' alt='The certificate file i.e. keystore file can be a .p12 file, need not be a \u2018.jks\u2019.' style='object-fit: contain; object-position: center'>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<p class='cover-credit'>\n\t<span class='cover-credit-anchor'>\n\t\t<button type='button' class='cover-credit-toggle' aria-expanded='false' aria-label='Image credit'>\n\t\t\t<svg xmlns='http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg' viewBox='0 0 16 16' width='14' height='14' aria-hidden='true' focusable='false'>\n\t\t\t\t<circle cx='8' cy='8' r='6.25' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.2'\/>\n\t\t\t\t<circle cx='8' cy='5.2' r='0.85' fill='currentColor'\/>\n\t\t\t\t<path fill='currentColor' d='M7.28 7.15h1.44v4.55H7.28z'\/>\n\t\t\t<\/svg>\n\t\t<\/button>\n\t\t<span class='cover-credit-popup'><span>Ujnotes<\/span> \u2014 <a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/creativecommons.org\/publicdomain\/zero\/1.0\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC0 1.0<\/a><\/span>\n\t<\/span>\n<\/p>\n\n\t<h2 class='center'>The certificate file i.e. keystore file can be a .p12 file, need not be a \u2018.jks\u2019.<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tThe certificate file i.e. keystore file can be a .p12 file, need not be a \u2018.jks\u2019.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t! Should be accessible by tomcat (user).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t?should have password?\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<strong>Default port.<\/strong> 443.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Prefer APR protocol<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t&lt;Connector port=\"1443\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tMaxThreads=\"200\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tEnableLookups=\"false\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDisableUploadTimeout=\"true\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAcceptCount=\"100\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDebug=\"0\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tScheme=\"https\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSecure=\"true\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tClientAuth=\"false\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSslProtocol=\"TLS\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSSLEnabled=\"true\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>keystoreFile=\"\/opt\/&lt;company&gt;\/_.keystore|p12\"<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tKeystoreType=\"PKCS12\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>keystorePass=\"password\"<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCiphers=\"SSL_RSA_WITH_RC4_128_MD5,SSL_RSA_WITH_RC4_128_SHA,TLS_RSA_WITH_AES_128_CBC_SHA,TLS_DHE_RSA_WITH_AES_128_CBC_SHA,TLS_DHE_DSS_WITH_AES_128_CBC_SHA,SSL_RSA_WITH_3DES_EDE_CBC_SHA,SSL_DHE_RSA_WITH_3DES_EDE_CBC_SHA,SSL_DHE_DSS_WITH_3DES_EDE_CBC_SHA,TLS_RSA_WITH_AES_256_CBC_SHA,TLS_DHE_RSA_WITH_AES_256_CBC_SHA,TLS_DHE_DSS_WITH_AES_256_CBC_SHA\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tURIEncoding=\"UTF-8\" \/&gt;.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>org.apache.coyote.http11.Http11Protocol<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>org.apache.coyote.http11.Http11Protocol &lt;Connector<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tProtocol=\"HTTP\/1.1\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPort=\"443\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tMaxThreads=\"200\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tScheme=\"https\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSecure=\"true\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSSLEnabled=\"true\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSSLCertificateFile=\"\/usr\/local\/ssl\/server.crt\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSSLCertificateKeyFile=\"\/usr\/local\/ssl\/server.pem\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSSLVerifyClient=\"optional\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSSLProtocol=\"TLSv1\"\/&gt;.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/ssl\/notes\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/ssl\/notes\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/ssl\/redirect_http_to_https' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/ssl\/redirect_http_to_https' data-title='Redirect: HTTP to HTTPS' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder